# ROOFCAT: snacks are worth 5; after 100 they are worth 20, after 200 they
# are worth 100.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 0
cheat put 60 83
wait 5
cheat snack 60 88
wait 3
expect score == 5
cheat snacks 100
cheat snack 60 88
wait 3
expect score == 25
cheat snacks 200
cheat snack 60 88
wait 3
expect score == 125
